#               operational half at git projection altitude).
# Substrate decisions:
#              [[architecture-shards-as-substrate-source]],
#              [[architecture-prism-as-trait-as-everything]],
#              [[architecture-mirror-as-content-addressed-build-system]]
#               (#43 LANDED; the ancestor recognition this species
#               closes at the git-projection altitude — every
#               Bazel/Buck2/Nix/Shake primitive is now declared at
#               substrate altitude through the N-cascade),
#              [[architecture-form-process-partition-at-family-root]]
#               (#55; @kintsugi is process-side, @mirror is form-
#               side; this species sits on process-side, discharges
